  "name": "rustc.js",
  "description": "rustc.js provides a JavaScript-based orchestration layer for the Rust compiler, targeting WebAssembly environments for in-browser and server-side compilation. It abstracts the underlying rustc and LLVM toolchain into a high-level programmatic interface capable of transforming crate source into executable WASM modules. This enables dynamic, client-side compilation for web-based IDEs and high-performance polyglot runtimes.",
